Usage:
  freehsm-audit dump   <path.audit.log> [path...]
  freehsm-audit verify <path.audit.log> <audit_key_hex_64>
  freehsm-audit verify <directory>         <audit_key_hex_64>

  A directory verifies every base.NNNNNN log in it and
  reports holes in the numbering, which is how a removed
  log becomes visible.
